Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.08,0:02:36.00,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨吗 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.46,0:02:49.06,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}知道自己没有才能
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.06,0:02:51.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}但这能成为苟且偷生的借口吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.57,0:02:54.03,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}在内心深处响起的悲鸣
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.14,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}究竟由谁来回应
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.14,0:03:00.04,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}至少在一生中有那么几次
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.98,0:03:04.78,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}想做个正直的当事者
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.63,0:03:08.19,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}倘若那就是今天？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.21,0:03:13.75,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐惧吗 再次睁开双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.08,0:03:18.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨吗 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}然而 你已经察觉到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.47,0:03:22.10,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}身体已无法停滞不前
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.10,0:03:27.35,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.35,0:03:30.97,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「这点恐惧便不值一提」
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.18,0:03:32.73,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.38,0:03:35.26,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}不惜性命放声高歌
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.58,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.59,0:03:40.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知晓
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.02,0:03:42.62,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.49,0:03:44.84,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在这里结束吗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.84,0:03:48.08,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}这绝非你所愿吧
